ne;\n  }\n  .flowers-left {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 190px;\n    left: 5px;\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 220px;\n    z-index: 0;\n    border: none;\n    background: none;\n  }\n  .ducks-bottom {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 560px;\n    height: 130px;\n    z-index: 0;\n    border: none;\n    background: none;\n  }\n  .page-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 10px;\n    left: 20px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"top-instructions\">\n    1.三首古诗都要能背诵能<br>\n    默写；2.能翻译每句诗的<br>\n    意思；3.注释栏处的关键<br>\n    字词的意思都要掌握。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"header-title-vertical\">古诗三首</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-area\">\n\n    <div class=\"main-text\">\n\n      <div class=\"poem-block\">\n        <div class=\"poem-title\">绝句</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-author-pinyin\">fǔ</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-author\">[唐]杜甫</div>\n\n        <div class=\"poem-line\">迟日<sup>①</sup>江山丽，</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-line\">春风花草香。</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-line\">泥融<sup>②</sup>飞燕子，</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-line\">\n          <ruby>沙暖睡鸳鸯<rt>yuān yāng</rt></ruby><sup>③</sup>。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"poem-block\" style=\"margin-top:30px;\">\n        <div class=\"poem-title-pinyin\">huì chóng</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-title\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">惠崇春江晚景<sup>①</sup></div>\n        <div class=\"poem-author-pinyin\">sòng sū shì</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-author\">[宋]苏轼</div>\n\n        <div class=\"poem-line\">竹外桃花三两枝，</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-line\">春江水暖鸭先知。</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-line\" style=\"margin-bottom:0; font-size:10px; color:#555; letter-spacing:3px;\">lóu hāo</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-line\">蒌蒿满地芦芽<sup>②</sup>短，</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-line\" style=\"margin-bottom:0; font-size:10px; color:#555; letter-spacing:3px;\">tún</div>\n        <div class=\"poem-line\">正是河豚<sup>③</sup>欲上时。</div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"notes-column\">\n      <div class=\"red-loop\"></div>\n      <div class=\"notes-box\">\n        <div class=\"notes-header\">注释</div>\n        <div class=\"notes-list\">\n          <p>①〔迟日〕春天白天渐长，所以说\"迟日\"。</p>\n          <p>②〔泥融〕这里指泥土湿润。</p>\n          <p>③〔鸳鸯〕一种鸟，常在水边嬉戏，雄鸟与雌鸟常结对生活。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"zhongdian\">重点</div>\n\n        <div class=\"notes-header\">注释</div>\n        <div class=\"notes-list\">\n          <p>①惠崇是北宋名僧，能诗善画。这首诗是苏轼为惠崇的画作《春江晚景》所写的题画诗。</p>\n          <p>②〔芦芽〕芦苇的嫩芽。</p>\n          <p>③〔河豚〕一种有毒的鱼。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"speech-bubble\">\n    我能猜出\"蒌蒿\"是一种植物，因为……\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder bird-topleft\">[Illustration: 燕子]</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder flowers-left\">[Illustration: 桃花/枝叶装饰]</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder ducks-bottom\">[Illustration: 鸭子与花卉，底部装饰]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number\">2</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
